A quoted colon line is absorbed only by its own paragraph

```
> e
:::e
> :::
l
.
<blockquote><p>e
:::e
:::
l</p></blockquote>
```

```
> > e
> :::e
> :::
l
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote><p>e
:::e</p></blockquote>
  <div>

  </div>
</blockquote>
<p>l</p>
```

```
> > e
> :::e
> > :::
l
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote><p>e
:::e
:::
l</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> > e
:::e
> > :::
l
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote><p>e
:::e
:::
l</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> > > e
:::e
> > :::
l
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <blockquote><p>e
:::e</p></blockquote>
    <div>

    </div>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
<p>l</p>
```
